917</fpage><lpage>925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17395626</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006586-Li1"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Naren</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Macromolecular complexes of cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator and its interacting partners.</article-title><source>Pharmacol Ther</source><volume>108</volume><fpage>208</fpage><lpage>223</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15936089</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006586-Gamper1"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gamper</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Shapiro</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Calmodulin mediates Ca2&#x0002b;-dependent modulation of M-type K&#x0002b; channels.</article-title><source>J Gen Physiol</source><volume>122</volume><fpage>17</fpage><lpage>31</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12810850</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006586-Li2"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Roy</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dandridge</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Naren</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Molecular assembly of cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator in plasma membrane.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>279</volume><fpage>24673</fpage><lpage>24684</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15060073</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006586-Levitan1"><label>19</label><mixed-cit